	ISO 8859-7  (Greek)
	ISO 8859-9  (Turkish)
	ISO 8859-10 (Nordic)
	ISO 8859-13 (Baltic Rim)
	ISO 8859-14 (Celtic)
	ISO 8859-15 (Western European)
	ISO 8859-16 (South-Eastern European)
	OpenType World Glyph Set 1 (W1G)
	Adobe Latin 3
	Ghostscript Standard (ghostscript-fonts-std-8.11)


